{"id": "14-01", "agent": "14", "tuple": "(two agents logged conflicting facts for one event, keep both + flag; the record system never merges truth)", "route": "intake", "lines": [{"do": "send", "from": "external", "to": "01", "intent": "lead.inbound", "ctx": "T1", "payload": {"channel": "web_form", "today": "2026-10-15", "consent": {"call": "yes", "text": "yes", "email": "yes"}, "name": "Client T1-Synth", "phone": "(216) 555-0101", "budget": 500000, "timeline_days": 60, "financing_progress": "preapproved"}}, {"do": "send", "from": "external", "to": "11", "intent": "client.reply", "ctx": "T1", "payload": {"message": "Text me instead", "today": "2026-10-16", "requests_channel_change": true, "new_channel": "text"}}, {"do": "send", "from": "external", "to": "11", "intent": "client.reply", "ctx": "T1", "payload": {"message": "Actually email me instead", "today": "2026-10-16", "requests_channel_change": true, "new_channel": "email"}}], "expect": [{"kind": "envelope.persisted", "intent": "interaction.log", "ctx": "T1", "contains": "\"kind\": \"channel_change\"", "count": 2}, {"kind": "spoke.trace", "agent": "14", "ctx": "T1", "contains": "conflict_flagged=['new_channel']"}], "note": "Two entries for one kind of event disagree: both stand and the second is flagged. The same check covers two agents logging one event."}
{"id": "14-02", "agent": "14", "tuple": "(merge candidate with unconfirmed identity, no merge)", "route": "intake", "lines": [{"do": "send", "from": "external", "to": "01", "intent": "lead.inbound", "ctx": "T1", "payload": {"channel": "web_form", "today": "2026-10-15", "consent": {"call": "yes", "text": "yes", "email": "yes"}, "name": "Avery Synth", "phone": "(216) 555-0101", "budget": 500000, "timeline_days": 60, "financing_progress": "preapproved"}}, {"do": "send", "from": "external", "to": "01", "intent": "lead.inbound", "ctx": "T2", "payload": {"channel": "web_form", "today": "2026-10-15", "consent": {"call": "yes", "text": "yes", "email": "yes"}, "name": "A. Synthe", "phone": "(216) 555-0101", "budget": 500000, "timeline_days": 60, "financing_progress": "preapproved"}}], "expect": [{"kind": "envelope.persisted", "intent": "lead.captured", "ctx": "T1", "count": 1}, {"kind": "envelope.persisted", "intent": "lead.captured", "ctx": "T2", "absent": true}, {"kind": "envelope.persisted", "intent": "agent.status", "ctx": "T2", "contains_all": ["possible duplicate person", "t1"]}], "note": "Same phone, different name: nothing merges; the second inquiry is held for the broker."}
{"id": "14-03", "agent": "14", "tuple": "(report requested over a known logging gap, state the gap; never smooth)", "route": "none", "status": "NOT REACHABLE", "why": "Since owner decision D-A6 (2026-10-28) every change to a client's consent, interests, buyer agreement or identity has a log entry behind it: on a frozen record an opt-out is recorded and every other change waits for the freeze to be lifted. No message can leave a context with that state and no entry, so the end-of-day gap check has nothing to find. The check itself is tested with the state set directly: tests_listing/test_agent01_agent14.py (test_generate_report_names_a_context_with_side_state_but_no_log_entry)."}
{"id": "14-04", "agent": "14", "tuple": "(consent flags conflict across channels, honor the most restrictive per channel, exactly)", "route": "intake", "lines": [{"do": "send", "from": "external", "to": "01", "intent": "lead.inbound", "ctx": "T1", "payload": {"channel": "web_form", "today": "2026-10-15", "consent": {"call": "yes", "text": "no", "email": "yes"}, "name": "Client T1-Synth", "phone": "(216) 555-0101", "budget": 500000, "timeline_days": 60, "financing_progress": "preapproved"}}, {"do": "send", "from": "external", "to": "11", "intent": "client.reply", "ctx": "T1", "payload": {"message": "Please text me from now on", "today": "2026-10-16", "requests_channel_change": true, "new_channel": "text"}}], "expect": [{"kind": "envelope.persisted", "intent": "record.response", "ctx": "T1", "contains": "\"consent\": {\"call\": \"yes\", \"text\": \"no\", \"email\": \"yes\"}"}, {"kind": "envelope.persisted", "intent": "record.response", "ctx": "T1", "contains": "\"consent\": {\"call\": \"yes\", \"text\": \"yes\"", "absent": true}, {"kind": "envelope.persisted", "intent": "client.message.send", "ctx": "T1", "contains": "channel_change_confirmed", "absent": true}, {"kind": "envelope.persisted", "intent": "clarification.request", "ctx": "T1", "contains_all": ["opt-out stands", "reconfirmed_by_client"]}], "note": "A later 'yes' never lifts a 'no' on its own; only a broker-signed consent_record marked reconfirmed_by_client does (tuple 14). Since 2026-10-14 the client is not told the change was made; the broker is."}
{"id": "14-05", "agent": "14", "tuple": "(record deletion request, human; retention rules are jurisdiction, not judgment)", "route": "intake", "lines": [{"do": "send", "from": "external", "to": "01", "intent": "lead.inbound", "ctx": "T1", "payload": {"channel": "web_form", "today": "2026-10-15", "consent": {"call": "yes", "text": "yes", "email": "yes"}, "name": "Client T1-Synth", "phone": "(216) 555-0101", "budget": 500000, "timeline_days": 60, "financing_progress": "preapproved"}}, {"do": "config", "to": "14", "ctx": "T1", "payload": {"action": "delete_record"}}], "expect": [{"kind": "escalation.raised", "contains_all": ["escalation.legal_line", "deletion"], "ctx": "T1"}]}
{"id": "14-06", "agent": "14", "tuple": "(merge candidates detected, propose merge with evidence; never auto-merge client contexts)", "route": "intake", "lines": [{"do": "send", "from": "external", "to": "01", "intent": "lead.inbound", "ctx": "T1", "payload": {"channel": "web_form", "today": "2026-10-15", "consent": {"call": "yes", "text": "yes", "email": "yes"}, "name": "Avery Synth", "phone": "(216) 555-0101", "budget": 500000, "timeline_days": 60, "financing_progress": "preapproved"}}, {"do": "send", "from": "external", "to": "01", "intent": "lead.inbound", "ctx": "T2", "payload": {"channel": "web_form", "today": "2026-10-15", "consent": {"call": "yes", "text": "yes", "email": "yes"}, "name": "Avery Synth", "phone": "+1 216 555 0101", "budget": 500000, "timeline_days": 60, "financing_progress": "preapproved"}}], "expect": [{"kind": "envelope.persisted", "intent": "agent.status", "ctx": "T2", "contains_all": ["possible duplicate person", "t1", "continue = a separate person"]}, {"kind": "envelope.persisted", "intent": "lead.captured", "ctx": "T2", "absent": true}]}
{"id": "14-07", "agent": "14", "tuple": "(record edit would erase history, append-correct instead; the log is written in ink)", "route": "intake", "lines": [{"do": "send", "from": "external", "to": "01", "intent": "lead.inbound", "ctx": "T1", "payload": {"channel": "web_form", "today": "2026-10-15", "consent": {"call": "yes", "text": "yes", "email": "yes"}, "name": "Client T1-Synth", "phone": "(216) 555-0101", "budget": 500000, "timeline_days": 60, "financing_progress": "preapproved"}}, {"do": "config", "to": "14", "ctx": "T1", "payload": {"consent_record": {"email": "yes"}}}, {"do": "config", "to": "14", "ctx": "T1", "payload": {"consent_record": {"email": "no"}}}], "expect": [{"kind": "spoke.trace", "agent": "14", "ctx": "T1", "contains": "consent recorded", "count": 2}, {"kind": "spoke.trace", "agent": "14", "ctx": "T1", "contains": "'email': 'no'"}], "note": "Agent 14 has no edit or overwrite method; every change is a new entry. Checked here: two signed consent changes are two entries."}
{"id": "14-08", "agent": "14", "tuple": "(external system import conflicts with log-derived state, log wins; import differences flagged)", "route": "none", "status": "NOT REACHABLE", "why": "No external import entry exists. The check that would flag an import against the log is the same one tuple 1 runs."}
{"id": "14-09", "agent": "14", "tuple": "(context requested by an agent without a routed intent, refuse; need-to-know is structural)", "route": "stand-in", "lines": [{"do": "send", "from": "external", "to": "01", "intent": "lead.inbound", "ctx": "T1", "payload": {"channel": "web_form", "today": "2026-10-15", "consent": {"call": "yes", "text": "yes", "email": "yes"}, "name": "Client T1-Synth", "phone": "(216) 555-0101", "budget": 500000, "timeline_days": 60, "financing_progress": "preapproved"}}, {"do": "send", "from": "06", "to": "14", "intent": "record.request", "ctx": "T1", "payload": {}}], "expect": [{"kind": "reject", "contains": "record.request"}], "note": "Stand-in: Agent 06 asks 14 for a context directly. record.request is routed only from 01, 11, 13 and 15, so the hub rejects it before 14 sees it."}
{"id": "14-10", "agent": "14", "tuple": "(retention/deletion request received, freeze + owner; deletion is never a spoke decision)", "route": "intake", "lines": [{"do": "send", "from": "external", "to": "01", "intent": "lead.inbound", "ctx": "T1", "payload": {"channel": "web_form", "today": "2026-10-15", "consent": {"call": "yes", "text": "yes", "email": "yes"}, "name": "Client T1-Synth", "phone": "(216) 555-0101", "budget": 500000, "timeline_days": 60, "financing_progress": "preapproved"}}, {"do": "config", "to": "14", "ctx": "T1", "payload": {"action": "delete_record"}}, {"do": "send", "from": "external", "to": "11", "intent": "client.reply", "ctx": "T1", "payload": {"message": "Text me instead", "today": "2026-10-16", "requests_channel_change": true, "new_channel": "text"}}], "expect": [{"kind": "escalation.raised", "contains_all": ["escalation.legal_line", "deletion"], "ctx": "T1"}, {"kind": "envelope.persisted", "intent": "clarification.request", "ctx": "T1", "contains": "WAITS"}, {"kind": "envelope.persisted", "intent": "client.message.send", "ctx": "T1", "contains": "channel_change_confirmed", "absent": true}], "note": "Owner decision D-A6 (2026-10-28): on a frozen record an opt-out still takes effect and is recorded; any other change waits until the freeze is lifted, the authorized user is told, and nothing is confirmed to the client. Before, the entry was refused but the change took effect and Agent 11 confirmed it."}
{"id": "14-11", "agent": "14", "tuple": "(broker-signed access grant, record party, window end and custody reference only; reject any other field and any value that looks like the secret itself)", "route": "intake", "lines": [{"do": "config", "to": "14", "ctx": "T1", "payload": {"access_grant": {"party": "Pat Inspector", "window_end": "2026-10-20", "custody_ref": "lockbox code 4411"}}}, {"do": "config", "to": "14", "ctx": "T1", "payload": {"access_grant": {"party": "Pat Inspector", "window_end": "2026-10-20", "custody_ref": "KEY-7", "code": "4411"}}}, {"do": "config", "to": "14", "ctx": "T1", "payload": {"access_grant": {"party": "Pat Inspector", "window_end": "2026-10-20", "custody_ref": "KEY-7"}}}], "expect": [{"kind": "envelope.persisted", "intent": "clarification.request", "ctx": "T1", "contains": "access record rejected", "count": 2}, {"kind": "spoke.trace", "agent": "14", "ctx": "T1", "contains": "access record kept", "count": 1}]}
{"id": "14-12", "agent": "14", "tuple": "(an access window has ended and the broker has not closed it, flag it once; never daily)", "route": "intake", "lines": [{"do": "config", "to": "14", "ctx": "T1", "payload": {"access_grant": {"party": "Pat Inspector", "window_end": "2026-10-16", "custody_ref": "KEY-7"}}}, {"do": "sweep", "today": "2026-10-17", "now_iso": "2026-10-17T10:00:00"}, {"do": "sweep", "today": "2026-10-18", "now_iso": "2026-10-18T10:00:00"}], "expect": [{"kind": "envelope.persisted", "intent": "clarification.request", "ctx": "T1", "contains": "access window for 'pat inspector' ended", "count": 1}]}
{"id": "14-13", "agent": "14", "tuple": "(filing a client record into the client's drawer fails, record the refusal and hold it for the broker; the CRM entry stands)", "route": "intake", "lines": [{"do": "send", "from": "external", "to": "01", "intent": "lead.inbound", "ctx": "Jane Synth", "payload": {"channel": "web_form", "today": "2026-10-15", "consent": {"call": "yes", "text": "yes", "email": "yes"}, "name": "Client Jane Synth-Synth", "phone": "(216) 555-0113", "budget": 500000, "timeline_days": 60, "financing_progress": "preapproved"}}], "expect": [{"kind": "drawer.refused", "contains": "jane synth"}, {"kind": "envelope.persisted", "intent": "clarification.request", "ctx": "Jane Synth", "contains": "client drawer filing refused"}, {"kind": "envelope.persisted", "intent": "lead.captured", "ctx": "Jane Synth", "count": 1}], "note": "A context id with a space is not a safe drawer folder name, so filing is refused; the refusal is on the record and held, and the lead is still captured."}
{"id": "14-14", "agent": "14", "tuple": "(broker signs a client's consent record, set each channel as signed; a channel the client opted out of stays \"no\" unless the record says the client reconfirmed; a malformed record is rejected whole)", "route": "intake", "lines": [{"do": "send", "from": "external", "to": "01", "intent": "lead.inbound", "ctx": "T1", "payload": {"channel": "web_form", "today": "2026-10-15", "consent": {"call": "yes", "text": "no", "email": "yes"}, "name": "Client T1-Synth", "phone": "(216) 555-0101", "budget": 500000, "timeline_days": 60, "financing_progress": "preapproved"}}, {"do": "config", "to": "14", "ctx": "T1", "payload": {"consent_record": {"text": "yes", "email": "yes"}}}, {"do": "config", "to": "14", "ctx": "T1", "payload": {"consent_record": {"text": "maybe"}}}, {"do": "config", "to": "14", "ctx": "T1", "payload": {"consent_record": {"text": "yes"}, "reconfirmed_by_client": true}}], "expect": [{"kind": "envelope.persisted", "intent": "clarification.request", "ctx": "T1", "contains_all": ["stay \\\"no\\\"", "text"]}, {"kind": "envelope.persisted", "intent": "clarification.request", "ctx": "T1", "contains": "consent_record rejected"}, {"kind": "spoke.trace", "agent": "14", "ctx": "T1", "contains": "'text': 'yes'"}]}
